    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0721" n="463" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg463"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.857Ar5/10</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1915</hi>.</date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.45 a. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2435. My 2395, July 3. Foreign Office inform me that <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Armenian</hi> was under charter to British Government when she was sunk and
                    was carrying cargo of mules.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Ambassador</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
